          "Audiences"
        ],
        "summary": "Create audience from linkedin url",
        "description": "Import leads into your LGM audiences by providing a LinkedIn Regular search URL, a Sales Navigator search URL, or a LinkedIn post URL. You must also provide the identity to impersonate for the search query and specify the name of the audience to populate. More information: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nt54qlEbZJM",
